-q3-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"LAMR 2020 Q4","e":"lamr","d":"2021-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean E. Reilly","x":"Meanwhile, our cost cutting initiatives continued to pay dividends.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/lamar-advertising-co-lamr-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"LAMR 2020 Q4","e":"lamr","d":"2021-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jay Lecoryelle Johnson","x":"Our cost reduction initiatives once again proved effective with consolidated operating expenses declining 10.6% in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/lamar-advertising-co-lamr-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"LAMR 2021 Q1","e":"lamr","d":"2021-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jay L. Johnson","x":"2020 cost reduction initiatives, implemented in response to COVID-19, continues to prove effective with consolidated operating expenses declining 9% in Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/lamar-advertising-co-lamr-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"LAMR 2021 Q2","e":"lamr","d":"2021-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jay Lecoryelle Johnson","x":"As you may recall, in response to [Technical Issues], we implemented several cost reduction initiatives during 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/lamar-advertising-company-lamr-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"LAMR 2021 Q2","e":"lamr","d":"2021-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sean E. Reilly","x":"As you saw in the release, we are raising our guidance again as I suggested we might on the last call, we now believe full year AFFO per share will come at -- come in between $6.10 and $6.30 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/lamar-advertising-company-lamr-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"LAMR 2021 Q4","e":"lamr","d":"2022-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sean Reilly","x":"I'm going to highlight a couple of things around our rate increases that we're seeing in Q4, just to highlight the pricing power in our platform both digital and our analog inventory.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/25/lamar-advertising-lamr-q4-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"LAMR 2021 Q4","e":"lamr","d":"2022-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sean Reilly","x":"So, clearly, we have pricing power with our digital unit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/25/lamar-advertising-lamr-q4-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"LAMR 2022 Q2","e":"lamr","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Richard Choe","x":"Are you seeing more, I guess, people not renew because of the price increases?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/03/lamar-advertising-lamr-q2-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"LAMR 2025 Q3","e":"lamr","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jay Lecoryelle Johnson","x":"Acquisition-adjusted operating expenses increased 3.7% in the third quarter, including one-time severance costs associated with the termination of our Vancouver transit contract on July 31, as well as increased costs from Phase two of our technology implementation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/lamar-advertising-lamr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAMR 2026 Q2","e":"lamr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Cameron McVeigh","x":"And then just secondly, Sean and Jay, I'd be curious what the latest is on your cost savings initiatives?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/lamar-advertising-lamr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAMR 2026 Q2","e":"lamr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Sean Reilly","x":"We've had some wins that are going to result in some cost savings in out years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/lamar-advertising-lamr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAMR 2026 Q2","e":"lamr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Sean Reilly","x":"With that in mind, we have raised our guidance for full year AFFO to a range of $8.75 to $8.90 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/lamar-advertising-lamr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAMR 2026 Q3","e":"lamr","d":"2026-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Sean Reilly","x":"With those results in hand, today, we are raising our guidance for full year AFFO to a range of $8.87 to $8.97 per share representing at the midpoint, an increase of 8% over 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/lamar-advertising-lamr-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,2151,0,0,0,1509,258],[36,1,5313,0,0,0,3508,1283],[38,1,2825,0,0,0,1922,485],[39,1,2300,0,0,0,1590,286],[40,1,2613,0,0,0,2108,150],[41,1,5772,0,0,0,4637,702],[42,1,3444,0,0,0,2893,134],[43,1,3838,0,0,0,2898,552],[44,1,4394,0,0,0,3605,386],[45,1,3962,0,0,0,3213,359],[46,1,3787,0,0,0,3215,228],[48,1,3517,0,0,0,3038,88],[50,1,4845,0,0,0,3693,773],[63,1,2241,0,0,0,1804,247],[64,1,3555,0,0,0,3075,323],[65,1,2766,0,0,0,2311,312],[66,1,4064,0,0,0,1150,2549],[67,1,2560,0,0,0,1064,1193]],"cinema":[[35,1,2151,0,0,0,1509,258],[36,1,5313,0,0,0,3508,1283],[38,1,2825,0,0,0,1922,485],[39,1,2300,0,0,0,1590,286],[40,1,2613,0,0,0,2108,150],[41,1,5772,0,0,0,4637,702],[42,1,3444,0,0,0,2893,134],[43,1,3838,0,0,0,2898,552],[44,1,4394,0,0,0,3605,386],[45,1,3962,0,0,0,3213,359],[46,1,3787,0,0,0,3215,228],[48,1,3517,0,0,0,3038,88],[50,1,4845,0,0,0,3693,773],[63,1,2241,0,0,0,1804,247],[64,1,3555,0,0,0,3075,323],[65,1,2766,0,0,0,2311,312],[66,1,4064,0,0,0,1150,2549],[67,1,2560,0,0,0,1064,1193]],"imax":[[35,1,2151,0,0,0,1509,258],[36,1,5313,0,0,0,3508,1283],[38,1,2825,0,0,0,1922,485],[39,1,2300,0,0,0,1590,286],[40,1,2613,0,0,0,2108,150],[41,1,5772,0,0,0,4637,702],[42,1,3444,0,0,0,2893,134],[43,1,3838,0,0,0,2898,552],[44,1,4394,0,0,0,3605,386],[45,1,3962